<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel sees 96 net at around 700 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Piltel sees 96 net at around 700 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellular firm and paging operator Pilipino Telephone Corp (Piletel) said on Monday it sees its net income for 1996 &quot;in the vicinity&quot; of 700 million pesos.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said that this is despite a provision of 887 million pesos for doubtful accounts.</p>
</text>
